		{
			description: [
				"Stone, redstone and a glass pane make a full Lua computer"
				"with a terminal, a filesystem and a shell."
				""
				"Place it and start typing. `help` lists the manuals,"
				"`programs` lists what it can run, and `edit startup.lua`"
				"begins your career."
			]
