			dependencies: ["7B37010300020000"]
			description: [
				"A note block with opinions. Attached to a computer it plays"
				"notes, sound effects, even streamed audio through the"
				"speaker API."
				""
				"Doorbells, alarms, a jukebox that takes requests — it is the"
